A||||8||mrfixit58||The Miracle of WD-40!||||3||
Z||000000||mrfixit58||07-26-2000||04:44 PM||||Just wanted to pass along a tip I found out about this weekend...<P>I asked several weeks ago if anyone knew how to remove the goo that drips from the leather steering wheels and land on the drivers seat. I had a perfect drivers seat except for this big blob of steering wheel goo. I got no response.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I tried acetone but that didn't work. With nothing to loose I decided to try WD-40. I kept squirting it and scrubbing with a clean cotton rag. After several application, the spot is virtually gone! <P>I followed the WD-40 with Hoover (brand) Carpet Cleaner and a scrub brush then a Bissel (?) wet vacuum. The seat turned out great.<P>Maybe this will help someone,<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||3
Z||000001||fropuff||07-26-2000||05:19 PM||||By this "goo" crap, do you mean that part of the steering wheel actually drips off?  I've never heard of this before.  ||||reg||10
Z||000002||Robert||07-26-2000||07:06 PM||||You would if you owned a GT and the temperature got above 90.  Just one of those Fiero things…..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/T2.GIF"> ||||reg||10
Z||000003||fropuff||07-26-2000||09:06 PM||||I do.  I have an '86 GT.  But, I live in Minnesota.  Don't have to worry about the temp. getting above 90.||||reg||1
Z||000004||hugh||07-26-2000||09:19 PM||||I read an article a few years back about the beneficial effects of WD-40 on arthritis pain relief.This is no joke!||||reg||1
Z||000005||tgowens||07-26-2000||09:38 PM||||why Robert -- my '87GT wheel never dripped and we had 114 in Paso -- many days over 100 -- must just be that chocolate covered bananna of yours!! (your car is on fire -- going for the deep fried bananna look??) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Moticon5_5.gif">  -- by the way guys -- Goo Gone works very well too -- I got all the tar off of my headliner with that!! <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
Z||000006||2birds||07-27-2000||11:18 PM||||Mine's been oozing ever since I moved down to the deep south.  5 years in Virginia, never had a problem, but Georgia...<P>Mr Mike will make it all better for about $185.  Someday, it'll get done.||||reg||1
