Z||000008||stsmithgt||07-28-2000||12:02 PM||||That goo is what got me to buy a Grant corsa "D" shaped wheel.  I tried finding a picture of it, but the pictures they show of a D shaped wheel is more rounded than mine.  I need to get a digital camera one of these days.  It's real comfortable.  Sort of funky steering in a parking lot, but it was worth getting use to it.||||reg||3
